      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-12-23T19:16:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>The wording on Santa Guise's incap side says \"Flip 1 face-down card\", not one face-down hero card. &nbsp;As far as I know, this is the only way to flip an arbitrary face down card. &nbsp;Certainly this can work advantageously against Guise's nemesis Wager Master as you can return a favorable condition card into play, but where else can this be used? &nbsp;Can you flip face down cards that are under other cards, like from La Capitan or Savage Mana?</span></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:58.590Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
