      "raw": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; line-height: 20px;\">The wording on Santa Guise&#39;s incap side says &quot;Flip 1 face-down card&quot;, not one face-down hero card. &nbsp;As far as I know, this is the only way to flip an arbitrary face down card. &nbsp;Certainly this can work advantageously against Guise&#39;s nemesis Wager Master as you can return a favorable condition card into play, but where else can this be used? &nbsp;Can you flip face down cards that are under other cards, like from La Capitan or Savage Mana?</span></p>",
