      "raw": "[quote=\"carnilius\"]\n\nThe wording on Santa Guise&#39;s incap side says &quot;Flip 1 face-down card&quot;, not one face-down hero card. &nbsp;As far as I know, this is the only way to flip an arbitrary face down card. &nbsp;Certainly this can work advantageously against Guise&#39;s nemesis Wager Master as you can return a favorable condition card into play, but where else can this be used? &nbsp;Can you flip face down cards that are under other cards, like from La Capitan or Savage Mana?\n\n[/quote]\n\nSure you could flip the cards over under la capitan or savage mana. but they are still &quot;under&quot; those other cards and would continue to not have text.\n\nThe flip a card thing really is a call to his nemesis Wager Master. EmoSpite also has his drugs you could flip, though not sure why you would want to do that.\n",
